ices with no holes and keep","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their laws. A conformer reports them only while it has no holes of that kind.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Algorithms over the incidence rows use this refinement to number the live vertices and edges"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with arrays while holes exist, instead of hashing every vertex and edge they meet. The bounds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are upper bounds only. Positions are never reused, so a bound counts every position ever handed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out, and nothing in the library allocates by it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Graph"},{"text":"’s laws:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"containsVertex(atPosition: p)"},{"type":"text","text":" is true exactly for the positions of live vertices, all in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<vertexPositionBound"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertexPosition(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertex(atPosition:)"},{"type":"text","text":" are inverses, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the live vertices in increasing position. Likewise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"containsEdge(atPosition:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is true exactly for the positions in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"type":"text","text":", all in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<edgePositionBound"},{"type":"text","text":", which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"type":"text","text":" lists in increasing order."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without holes, the bounds equal "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertexIndexBound"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edgeIndexBound"},{"type":"text","text":", and positions are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"_numberedIncidenceRows()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" numbers the live vertices "},{"code":"0..<vertexCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the live edges "},{"code":"0..<edgeCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":"edges","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order, and lists, for each vertex number, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"numbers of the far ends of its edge ends with the edge numbers beside them, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"incidentEdges(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order (a self-loop twice)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/SparselyIndexedGraph/containsEdge(atPosition:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Whether a live edge sits at ","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; false, without trapping, for any other integer.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O(1).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"containsEdge","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"atPosition","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"required":true,"type":"topic","title":"containsEdge(atPosition:)","identifier":"doc:\